      "writtenOn": "2023-03-31T16:01:49Z",
      "side": 0,
      "message": "That failure behavior depends on the StrongBox definition, right? I wouldn\u0027t be surprised if `GenerateKey` passes on one implementation and fails on another.",
      "parentUuid": "89e633ee_582ef930",
      "revId": "a4ccb03efdd7824745cb0c62433065ef3f682346",
